The bug was caused by improper handling of the "NoSuchKey" error when attempting to retrieve a file from the S3 filesystem. Instead of returning a null value when the key does not exist, an `IOException` was thrown, which disrupted the normal flow of operations and caused failures in S3 filesystem interactions.

